WEBVTT

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.864
Noah: Good morning Maya! Were you able to prepare the weekly review?

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:12.152
Maya: Not yet. I have three files to check, data to pull from two applications, and a report

00:00:12.152 --> 00:00:12.848
to finish.

00:00:13.098 --> 00:00:14.462
Noah: All of that, today?

00:00:14.662 --> 00:00:16.540
Maya: And it's only the start of the day.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:23.091
Companies already have tools to communicate, store their documents, manage their customers

00:00:23.091 --> 00:00:24.801
and track their activities.

00:00:25.051 --> 00:00:30.862
Yet much of the work still consists of looking for information, switching from one application

00:00:30.862 --> 00:00:33.582
to another, and redoing the same operations.

00:00:33.832 --> 00:00:39.840
According to a 2022 survey of more than a thousand knowledge workers, people spend about

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.342
two hours a day on it.

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:46.262
Maya: We already have all the tools we need. Why is it still so complicated?

00:00:46.512 --> 00:00:48.340
Noah: Because they don't really work together.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:55.119
Noah: Now imagine assistants able to use those tools, to understand what you ask them, and

00:00:55.119 --> 00:00:57.660
to coordinate the operations needed.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.001
Maya: Like a chatbot?

00:00:59.151 --> 00:01:05.187
Noah: Not just that. A chatbot answers you. An agent can also use tools and move a task forward,

00:01:05.187 --> 00:01:07.199
within the limits you give it.

00:01:10.449 --> 00:01:17.038
That is Seshat's ambition: AI agents that take part in a company's real processes, beyond

00:01:17.038 --> 00:01:18.519
simple conversation.

00:01:19.169 --> 00:01:24.759
Maya: Prepare the weekly review, check the pending files, and tell me what is blocking.

00:01:25.209 --> 00:01:30.383
A coordinating agent analyzes the request and prepares a work plan.

00:01:30.533 --> 00:01:33.754
It then hands each part to a specialized agent.

00:01:33.904 --> 00:01:39.792
The first explores the authorized files and procedures, spots the missing documents,

00:01:39.792 --> 00:01:41.334
and cites its sources.

00:01:41.484 --> 00:01:47.090
The second queries the data, computes the indicators, and identifies the files that

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:47.698
are late.

00:01:47.848 --> 00:01:53.860
The third gathers the results, writes the summary, and flags what needs checking.

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:57.569
Maya: Wait… they can work together on the same request?

00:01:57.819 --> 00:02:03.361
Noah: Yes. Each agent handles part of the work, with the tools and permissions it has been

00:02:03.361 --> 00:02:03.889
granted.

00:02:04.239 --> 00:02:09.901
The result comes back to Maya, with the sources, the proposed actions and what remains

00:02:09.901 --> 00:02:13.851
to be decided. The data in this demonstration is fictitious.

00:02:13.851 --> 00:02:18.526
It is our vision of multi-agent work, which we build with each company.

00:02:19.276 --> 00:02:24.129
Noah: And some tasks can even start on their own, following rules defined in advance.

00:02:24.479 --> 00:02:30.923
A new file arrives. The workflow detects it, reads the documents, extracts the information,

00:02:30.923 --> 00:02:36.942
checks the fields, updates the authorized system, prepares the notification, and asks

00:02:36.942 --> 00:02:38.854
for validation when needed.

00:02:39.204 --> 00:02:42.651
From repetitive tasks to more complex workflows:

00:02:42.651 --> 00:02:46.887
linking tools, agents and people in one controlled process.

00:02:46.887 --> 00:02:51.483
That is our vision, and its first building blocks already exist.

00:02:52.233 --> 00:02:56.704
Maya: This is all interesting… but where does our confidential data go?

00:02:56.954 --> 00:02:58.129
Noah: It can stay with us.

00:02:58.579 --> 00:03:02.926
Seshat favors architectures that fit the company's requirements.

00:03:02.926 --> 00:03:08.563
With a private deployment and a local model, documents, indexes and processing stay

00:03:08.563 --> 00:03:10.329
within its infrastructure.

00:03:10.579 --> 00:03:16.384
In a hybrid architecture, only the communications explicitly chosen leave, towards the

00:03:16.384 --> 00:03:18.611
model provider you have selected.

00:03:18.861 --> 00:03:23.166
The choice of models, connections and hosting remains yours.

00:03:23.916 --> 00:03:26.901
Maya: And what if an agent tries to do something it shouldn't?

00:03:27.151 --> 00:03:31.781
Noah: That's why we define what it can do, what it cannot do, and what must be validated.

00:03:32.231 --> 00:03:38.446
Permissions, supervision, traceability. A sensitive action is suspended until a person

00:03:38.446 --> 00:03:43.578
agrees, and the operation is recorded. No mechanism removes every risk:

00:03:43.578 --> 00:03:46.541
that is why the human keeps the decision.

00:03:47.291 --> 00:03:50.441
Maya: And if a company wants to start, does it have to change everything?

00:03:50.691 --> 00:03:54.281
Noah: No. We start by identifying a concrete problem.

00:03:54.731 --> 00:04:00.818
The diagnosis maps the process, the tools, the data and the constraints.

00:04:00.818 --> 00:04:06.059
The pilot tests a first, limited use, on representative cases.

00:04:06.059 --> 00:04:13.921
The evaluation measures quality, processing time, costs, human interventions and reliability.

00:04:14.171 --> 00:04:20.317
And this is essential: according to Gartner, more than forty percent of agentic AI projects

00:04:20.317 --> 00:04:25.585
will be abandoned by the end of 2027, for lack of clear value or risk control.

00:04:25.835 --> 00:04:32.168
Seshat starts from the need, measures, then decides with you whether to continue, improve,

00:04:32.168 --> 00:04:33.505
or change approach.

00:04:35.455 --> 00:04:36.632
Noah: So, how is your review?

00:04:36.882 --> 00:04:44.632
Maya: Ready to be checked. And this time, I know exactly where the information comes from.

00:04:44.982 --> 00:04:48.437
Noah: See? The goal was never to replace your tools.

00:04:48.687 --> 00:04:50.569
Maya: It was to make them work together.

00:04:51.619 --> 00:04:55.745
Seshat AI. Your tools. Your data. Your agents.

00:04:55.745 --> 00:04:57.449
Under your control.
